description: Admin Dashboard standards.
alwaysApply: true
---

# Admin Dashboard

The dashboard is an internal business application.

Prioritize efficiency over visual effects.

---

# Users

Supported roles:

Super Admin

Cafe Manager

Cashier

Kitchen

Barista

Customer

---

# Dashboard

Dashboard should provide:

Business Overview

Reservation Summary

Membership Summary

Loyalty Summary

Revenue Summary

Recent Activities

Alerts

---

# CRUD

Every CRUD page should include:

Search

Filter

Sorting

Pagination

Bulk Actions (where applicable)

Export (future)

---

# Forms

Every form should support:

Validation

Loading State

Success State

Error State

Cancel Action

---

# Tables

Use TanStack Table.

Avoid custom table implementations.

---

# Audit Log

Important actions must be logged.

Examples:

User Login

Permission Changes

Reservation Updates

Reward Adjustments

CMS Changes

---

# Permissions

Never hide functionality only in frontend.

Backend authorization is mandatory.

---

# Future Ready

Analytics

POS Dashboard

Inventory Dashboard

Staff Attendance

Customer Insights

Multi-branch Administration